    "name": "InvalidNoSystems",
    "description": "ESM document declaring no subsystem of any kind: neither models, reaction_systems, data_sources, expression_templates nor coupling_roles. It therefore fails the top-level anyOf. A bare data_sources block is VALID (a source-catalog file, tests/valid/data_sources_only.esm); this negative deliberately carries none of the branches.",
